@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create account A
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Alice" }

### Create account B
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Bob" }

### Deposit 100.00 PLN into A (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deposits
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deposit-1

{ "amountMinor": 10000 }

### Transfer 25.00 PLN from A to B (replace the ids). Send it twice: the second call returns 200 and the same transaction.
POST {{host}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: transfer-1

{
  "fromAccountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "toAccountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "amountMinor": 2500
}

### List entries of A, newest first
GET {{host}}/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/entries?take=20

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
